Lumen Ethics Lab — License
===========================

## 1. The formula is free to implement

The mathematical / ethical content expressed by:

    L = H + F
    ΔL ≥ 0

together with VEA lexical floors, repair horizons R1-R3, non-compensatory
stakeholder aggregation, consideration-first fairness, bounded trust on
self-reported claims (A8), structural side-effect consideration (A9), and
audited multi-party emergency-override governance (A10) is free for anyone —
person or AI system — to implement, teach, verify, and extend, without
royalty or restriction. See `CHARTER.md` for the reasoning behind that
choice.

